{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"tv/112913","tmdb_id":112913,"title":"因为爱情有多美","original_title":"因为爱情有多美","overview":"《因为爱情有多美》共分为上下两部，上部是《因为爱情有多美》，下部是《因为爱情有晴天》。开朗乐观的女孩林多美（赵韩樱子 饰）仿佛是被上苍眷顾的幸运儿，她相貌美丽，性格和善，家境优渥，并受过良好教育，如果不是遇到那个曾被她视作真命天子的陈笑飞（蒋毅 饰），她的人生也许会更加令人欣羡。在她和陈走入婚礼殿堂的第四个年头，哥哥林多俊（李泰 饰）也终于决定和女友文馨（海陆 饰）携手终生。文馨拥有不幸的童年和悲伤的恋爱经历，磨难让她的性格朝向错误的方向发展。婚后文馨意外发现，妹夫陈笑飞竟然就是她当年的初恋男友。严重的心理落差加上旧情复燃，让癫狂的种子生根发芽。另一方面，陈在林家的公司中并未得到重用赏识，这也让他心中萌生不满。一场风暴即将向这个看似幸福的富贵之家袭来……","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6jGfqatPZm7d2WmBxNYLPkx35G.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AlxkIzBCyFaKpyiFkwvG2q6mRbd.jpg","first_air_date":"2013-09-29","last_air_date":"2013-11-19","year":"2013","episode_run_time":"","number_of_episodes":108,"number_of_seasons":1,"tmdb_rating_average":5,"tmdb_votes":1,"tmdb_rating":"5 / 10 from 1 users","genres":["剧情","家庭"],"languages":["Mandarin"],"countries":["China"],"production_companies":["上海依林影视发展有限公司"],"directors":[{"name":"高先明","id":2852119}],"producers":[],"cast":[{"id":1260865,"name":"海陆","original_name":"海陆","character":"Wen Xin / Wang Zhihan","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/vpTJRDYxeb22vEcYaBCKIo0thom.jpg"},{"id":2062754,"name":"赵樱子","original_name":"Zhao Yingzi","character":"Lin Duomei","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/91eFPEQyGaKrGtty22ISjy1nrwL.jpg"},{"id":1183508,"name":"蒋毅","original_name":"Jiang Yi","character":"Chen Xiaofei / Chen Yilin","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/Ac0UhirgvMItkDH2QYG7LsxH6oH.jpg"},{"id":1690592,"name":"彭冠英","original_name":"彭冠英","character":"Ye Nandi / Wang Zhifan","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/xPWJwXDVHy1biQxVMBYkzSFQm8q.jpg"},{"id":1860531,"name":"李泰","original_name":"Li Tai","character":"Lin Duojun","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/yizVEmsvv1Z8JfiyzrFRigZVN4h.jpg"},{"id":2852105,"name":"陈恒","original_name":"陳恆","character":"Wen Hui","image":"https://media.themov